  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Dear New Intern,


    Congratulations on your unpaid internship, and
    welcome to Hell!


    Hell is sorely in need of new talent to help refurbish
    the place after the previous  managers of Hell ran off to Wall Street for investment
    banking gigs. Good, honest corporations like us aren''t attractive enough to
    poach them back!


    That''s why we are giving you a chance. You. An under-qualified,
    previously-jobless literal arts student from some no-name university.


    Hell
    is currently undergoing some construction. It feeds on the pain of souls suffering
    eternal torment, but our souls were also snatched by the banks.


    Your task
    is to <s>kidnap</s> recruit some souls to suffer in our various hells. Expand
    Hell as much as you can, and we will consider you for a full-time, minimum-wage
    employee position!


    Good luck. Don''t end up in hell yourself!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
