  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4b1bef26a0b6487ca3722c45974ddc0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RoomLog
  entries:
  - "Being digested is a whole different beast. You really feel it in your bones.
    Also, don\u2019t mind the kid in the corner. He has mommy issues, or something."
  - "Upset Stomach: Imagine how it feels to be a sandwich when the tummy starts rumbling.
    Now, you don\u2019t have to."
  - The big dinosaur skeleton in the back is now sentient. All it does is talk about
    types of houseplants, which may arguably be worse than being dissolved into nothingness.
  lockedEntry: 
  normalIcon: {fileID: -4120201662045105024, guid: 183261df104a947b5ade82d9a045ef08, type: 3}
